{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Snaptext Developer API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Snaptext OCR & Structured Document Extraction API. Power your apps with clean markdown/JSON layout results.\n\n## API Usage Flow\n\nHere is the recommended workflow to integrate Snaptext programmatically:\n\n### 1. Authentication\nInclude your API Key in the `Authorization` header for all requests:\n```http\nAuthorization: Bearer st-your_api_key\n```\n\n### 2. Submitting a Document\nYou have two ways to submit a PDF document for structured extraction:\n\n#### Option A: Submit via Public URL (Simplest)\nIf your PDF is already hosted on a public URL, submit it directly:\n* **Endpoint:** `POST /v1/jobs`\n* **Payload:**\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"pdfUrl\": \"https://example.com/document.pdf\",\n    \"filename\": \"document.pdf\",\n    \"fileSize\": 102450,\n    \"fileHash\": \"sha256_hash_of_file_here\",\n    \"ocrModelId\": \"Spark\"\n  }\n  ```\n\n#### Option B: Direct File Upload (Secure & Fast)\nIf the file is local, use secure pre-signed uploads:\n1. **Generate Upload URL:** Call `POST /v1/jobs/upload-url` with your file details.\n2. **Upload Binary:** Perform an HTTP PUT upload to the returned `uploadUrl` using the client `token` as authentication.\n3. **Submit Job:** Once uploaded, submit the job to `POST /v1/jobs` using the generated `pdfUrl` from step 1.\n\n### 3. Retrieve Extraction Results\nDocument processing runs asynchronously in the background. Periodically poll the job status:\n* **Endpoint:** `GET /v1/jobs/{id}` (supports either the UUID `jobId` or the `wrun_` run ID).\n* **States:** `pending` -> `running` -> `completed` (or `failed`).\n* **Output:** Once `completed`, the response will contain `data` (fully merged structured layout) and `pagesData` (individual page outputs).\n\n### 4. Cancel active tasks\n* To abort an active or pending extraction, call `POST /v1/jobs/{id}/cancel`."
  },
  "security": [
    {
      "ApiKeyAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:3000/api",
      "description": "Local development server"
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "ApiKeyAuth": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "Authorization",
        "description": "Format: Bearer st-<key>"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "CancelJobResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "jobId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "description": "UUID of the job"
          },
          "runId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Underlying workflow execution run ID"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "cancelled"
            ],
            "description": "Current status after cancellation"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "jobId",
          "runId",
          "status"
        ]
      },
      "CreateJobRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "pdfUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "Publicly accessible URL or pre-signed storage URL of the PDF"
          },
          "filename": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Original filename of the PDF"
          },
          "fileSize": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "exclusiveMinimum": true,
            "description": "File size in bytes"
          },
          "fileHash": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "SHA-256 hash of the file to prevent duplicate runs"
          },
          "ocrModelId": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "OCR Model Name (e.g., 'Flux', 'Spark', 'Zenith'), Model ID (e.g., 'google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview'), or model UUID"
          },
          "jsonSchema": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": {}
              }
            ],
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Optional JSON Schema for custom structured extraction layout"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "pdfUrl",
          "filename",
          "fileSize",
          "fileHash"
        ]
      },
      "CreateUploadUrlRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "filename": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Original name of the file to be uploaded"
          },
          "fileSize": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "exclusiveMinimum": true,
            "description": "File size in bytes (max 20MB)"
          },
          "fileHash": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "SHA-256 hash of the file payload"
          },
          "ocrModelId": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "OCR Model Name (e.g., 'Flux', 'Spark', 'Zenith'), Model ID (e.g., 'google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview'), or model UUID"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "filename",
          "fileSize",
          "fileHash"
        ]
      },
      "CreateUploadUrlResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "token": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Ephemeral client upload token for storage"
          },
          "pathname": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Storage pathname destination"
          },
          "uploadUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "Direct storage upload target URL"
          },
          "deduplicated": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Indicates if an identical job is already processing"
          },
          "jobId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "description": "UUID of the existing job if deduplicated"
          },
          "runId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Workflow execution run ID if deduplicated"
          },
          "pdfUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "Source URL of the existing job if deduplicated"
          }
        }
      },
      "JobDetailsResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "runId": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "filename": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "metadata": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "totalPages": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "completedPages": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "pdfUrl": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uri"
              },
              "createdAt": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              },
              "updatedAt": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              },
              "hasSchema": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "nullable": true
              },
              "modelName": {
                "type": "string",
                "nullable": true
              },
              "metrics": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "extractedPages": {
                    "type": "number"
                  },
                  "emptyPages": {
                    "type": "number"
                  },
                  "failedPages": {
                    "type": "number"
                  },
                  "mergeablePages": {
                    "type": "number"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "extractedPages",
                  "emptyPages",
                  "failedPages",
                  "mergeablePages"
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "totalPages",
              "completedPages",
              "pdfUrl",
              "createdAt",
              "updatedAt",
              "hasSchema",
              "schema",
              "modelName",
              "metrics"
            ]
          },
          "data": {
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Merged layout extraction structure of the document (JSON shape)"
          },
          "pagesData": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {},
            "description": "Individual extracted layout page outputs"
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "runId",
          "status",
          "filename",
          "metadata",
          "data",
          "pagesData",
          "error"
        ]
      },
      "JobIdParam": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "UUID of the job or wrun_ workflow execution run ID"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id"
        ]
      },
      "JobListItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "runId": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "filename": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "fileSize": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "pdfUrl": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "totalPages": {
            "type": "number",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "runId",
          "status",
          "filename",
          "fileSize",
          "pdfUrl",
          "totalPages",
          "error",
          "createdAt",
          "updatedAt"
        ]
      },
      "JobListResponse": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobListItem"
        }
      },
      "JobSubmissionResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "jobId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "description": "Unique identifier of the submitted job"
          },
          "runId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Underlying workflow execution run ID"
          },
          "pdfUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "Validated storage/source URL of the PDF"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Status of the job, defaults to pending"
          },
          "deduplicated": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Indicates if an active job was reused"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "jobId",
          "runId",
          "pdfUrl",
          "status"
        ]
      },
      "ListJobsParams": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "limit": {
            "default": 20,
            "description": "Number of items to return",
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 100
          },
          "offset": {
            "default": 0,
            "description": "Offset for pagination",
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "400": {
        "description": "Bad Request",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "error": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "Invalid request parameters"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "401": {
        "description": "Unauthorized",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "error": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "Authentication required"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "403": {
        "description": "Forbidden",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "error": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "Access denied"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "404": {
        "description": "Not Found",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "error": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "Resource not found"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "429": {
        "description": "Too Many Requests",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "error": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "Quota exceeded"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "500": {
        "description": "Internal Server Error",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "error": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "An unexpected error occurred"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/v1/jobs": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "get-v1-jobs",
        "summary": "List Jobs",
        "description": "Retrieve a paginated list of recent document extraction jobs submitted by the user.",
        "tags": [
          "V1"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "limit",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": 20,
              "description": "Number of items to return",
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 100
            },
            "description": "Number of items to return"
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "offset",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": 0,
              "description": "Offset for pagination",
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 9007199254740991
            },
            "description": "Offset for pagination"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "ApiKeyAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobListResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/400"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/500"
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "operationId": "post-v1-jobs",
        "summary": "Submit OCR Job",
        "description": "Initiates a new structured document extraction job. Accepts a direct URL or a pre-uploaded storage URL.",
        "tags": [
          "V1"
        ],
        "parameters": [],
        "security": [
          {
            "ApiKeyAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateJobRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobSubmissionResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/400"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/500"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/jobs/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "get-v1-jobs-{id}",
        "summary": "Get Job Status & Results",
        "description": "Retrieves real-time processing status, metadata metrics, and final merged schema layouts for a specific job.",
        "tags": [
          "V1"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "UUID of the job or wrun_ workflow execution run ID"
            },
            "description": "UUID of the job or wrun_ workflow execution run ID",
            "example": "123"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "ApiKeyAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobDetailsResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/400"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/500"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/jobs/upload-url": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "post-v1-jobs-upload-url",
        "summary": "Generate Upload Token",
        "description": "Generates a secure client token to upload PDF binaries directly to secure storage.",
        "tags": [
          "V1"
        ],
        "parameters": [],
        "security": [
          {
            "ApiKeyAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateUploadUrlRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateUploadUrlResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/400"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/500"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/jobs/{id}/cancel": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "post-v1-jobs-{id}-cancel",
        "summary": "Cancel OCR Job",
        "description": "Gracefully halts and aborts an active document processing workflow run.",
        "tags": [
          "V1"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "UUID of the job or wrun_ workflow execution run ID"
            },
            "description": "UUID of the job or wrun_ workflow execution run ID",
            "example": "123"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "ApiKeyAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CancelJobResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/400"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/500"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "V1"
    }
  ]
}
